@quickgo.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5010

### B1-01 Registrar empresa (Transportista) + admin
POST {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/empresas/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreComercial": "Transportes Honduras",
  "razonSocial": "Transportes Honduras S.A.",
  "rtn": "08019999123456",
  "tipo": "Transportista",
  "primerNombre": "Ana",
  "primerApellido": "López",
  "email": "ana@transportes.hn",
  "password": "Secreta123"
}

### B1-01 Login
POST {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@transportes.hn", "password": "Secreta123" }

### B1-03 Roles (reemplaza TOKEN por el del login)
GET {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/catalogos/roles
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### B1-04 Registrar conductor externo
POST {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/conductores
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "primerNombre": "Luis",
  "primerApellido": "Mejía",
  "tipoConductor": "Externo",
  "licencia": "LIC-0001",
  "venceLicencia": "2027-03-01"
}

### B1-05 Licencias por vencer en 60 días
GET {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/conductores/licencias-por-vencer?dias=60
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Modo Dev (solo Development): sin login, con headers
GET {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/conductores
X-Empresa-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
X-User-Id: 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
X-Rol: Despachador

### Crear envío
POST {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/envios
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "origenDireccionId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
  "destinoDireccionId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
  "tipoServicio": "Carga",
  "pesoKg": 120.5,
  "volumenM3": 2.4,
  "fechaProgramada": "2026-12-01T10:00:00-06:00",
  "tarifa": 2500
}

### Listar envíos por estado y rango de fechas
GET {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/envios?estado=Pendiente&desde=2026-11-19T00:00:00-06:00&hasta=2026-12-31T23:59:59-06:00
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Consultar detalle de un envío
GET {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/envios/66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Editar un envío pendiente
PUT {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/envios/66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "origenDireccionId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
  "destinoDireccionId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
  "tipoServicio": "Grua",
  "pesoKg": 120.5,
  "fechaProgramada": "2026-12-02T10:00:00-06:00",
  "tarifa": 2750
}

### Cancelar un envío pendiente o asignado
PATCH {{quickgo.API_HostAddress}}/api/envios/66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
